nture game set in contemporary Hong Kong. Players control Wei Shen, an undercover police officer who infiltrates a Triad organization called the Sun On Yee. Gameplay emphasizes melee combat using martial arts moves, grapples, and environmental attacks over gunplay, alongside driving, parkour, and open-world exploration. The game features a triple experience system split between Triad, Police, and Face progression paths, each unlocking different abilities and rewards.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/sleeping-dogs", "videos": [{"id": 893, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "IYZYsuqLJsY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IYZYsuqLJsY", "title": "Sleeping Dogs Available Now", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IYZYsuqLJsY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 142026, "name": "VGA 2009 Trailer", "video_id": "9v0GE9LDB4g", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9v0GE9LDB4g", "title": "True Crime: Hong Kong Reveal Trailer (Spike VGAs 09) HD", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/9v0GE9LDB4g/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 1010, "name": "Sleeping Dogs"}]}